# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# One root .gitignore for the merged repo. Every pattern from the two source
# repos, re-anchored to this layout. A pattern containing a slash is anchored
# to THIS file's directory -- that is why src/ stays at the repo root.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# --- Secrets. Only common.yaml and *.example.yaml are ever tracked. ---------
src/config/*.yaml
!src/config/common.yaml
!src/config/*.example.yaml

# --- Vendored downloads (excluded as downloads, not for licence reasons) ----
diagnostics/ladders/log-coverage/spec/*.yml
diagnostics/ladders/log-coverage/spec/*.yaml
!diagnostics/ladders/log-coverage/spec/inventory.json
notebooks/rbac/lib/
postgresql-ha-*.tgz
node_modules/

# --- Regenerated reports: the reviewed copy is committed by hand ------------
diagnostics/ladders/log-coverage/doc-log-coverage-results-*.md

# --- Capture output: hundreds of MB, never committed ------------------------
capture*/
*.log
# `capture*/` above also matches `captures/`, and git never descends into an
# excluded DIRECTORY -- so the directory must be re-included before its contents
# can be excluded and the keeper file negated. Order matters; later wins.
!diagnostics/outputs/captures/
diagnostics/outputs/captures/*
!diagnostics/outputs/captures/.gitignore

# --- Helm render dumps and scratch (CLAUDE.md forbids committing these) -----
*.render.txt
.scratch/

# --- Python ----------------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.py[oc]
*.pyc
build/
dist/
wheels/
*.egg-info
.venv
.pytest_cache/
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# --- Editors / OS / local agent state --------------------------------------
.idea
.DS_Store
.claude/.settings.local.json

# --- Cowork cannot delete inside the mount, so files it needs gone land here
_to_delete/
